config BR2_PACKAGE_HEXA_SETTINGS
	bool "hexa-settings"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_LIBGTK3
	help
	  The hexaOS Settings app: Wi-Fi and wired network, sound,
	  display, wallpaper and taskbar, keyboard, mouse and touchpad,
	  date and time, power, account, background services and
	  information about the computer. System changes go through
	  /usr/libexec/hexa-settings-helper, run with sudo.
